        "ver": "0.32.0",
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Medium shot: A curly-haired East Asian person in their 20s sprints down a crowded New York street.\n\n2. Tense close-up: the runner looks back over their shoulder while a determined man begins chasing from behind.\n\n3. Wide dynamic shot: the runner darts between pedestrians on a busy sidewalk. Strong perspective and rough motion lines emphasize speed.\n\n4. The pursuer pushes through the crowd, getting closer to the runner.\n\n5. The runner narrowly slips between a sidewalk hot dog cart and a yellow taxi at the curb.\n\n6. Dynamic angled shot: pedestrians recoil while the runner twists sideways through a narrow gap.\n\n7. Wide establishing shot: the chase crosses a busy Manhattan crosswalk beneath tall buildings.\n\n8. The runner accidentally bumps into a metal trash can near the entrance of an alley.\n\n9. Close action shot: the trash can tips over and garbage spills directly into the pursuer's path.\n\n10. The pursuer trips over the fallen trash can, arms thrown outward as he loses balance.\n\n11. Medium shot: the runner looks backward while continuing to accelerate, with the fallen pursuer visible far behind.\n\n12. Final wide shot: the runner disappears into a dense New York street crowd."
      ],
      "color": "#475b73",
      "bgcolor": "#243145"
    },
