      "widgets_values": [
        "ASSETS / REFERENCE ROLES:\n\nImage 1 = GRID LAYOUT.\nUse this image for panel layout only.\n\nImage 2 = PURSUER.\nThe man chasing the runner in SEQUENCE. Use the short slick dark hair, strong build, light gray suit, white shirt, and black shoes from this reference.\n\nImage 3 = RUNNER.\nThe curly-haired young East Asian runner in SEQUENCE. Use the curly short dark hair, light hoodie, dark cargo pants, and white sneakers from this reference.\n\nKeep each character's face, hair, outfit, and identity consistent across all shots.\nUse these images for character identity and costume only. Render everything in the STYLE below. Do not copy the reference sheets' color, labels, text, or multi-view layout."
